  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4906.02 Approval",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4906.02 Approval. The commissioner shall approve a training or examination program, upon recommendation by the fire marshal, that meets or exceeds the standard of the Silver or Gold Certificates of the National Oilheat Research Alliance or North American Training Excellence Oil Heating Technician’s Program.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06; ss by #9766-A, eff 8-3-10",
